  "prefLabel": "Pol 101.38 Qualified retired law enforcement officer identification",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pol 101.38 “Qualified retired law enforcement officer identification” means a photographic identification issued by the agency from which the qualified retired law enforcement officer retired from service certifying that the person meets the standards set forth in 18 U.S.C. 926C (d) (2A) and Pol 101.37.\n\nSource. #5836, eff 6-15-94; ss by #7301, eff 6-8-00; ss by 8925, eff 7-1-07",
